---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Newsletter from '../../components/Newsletter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Everyday AI Lab | Only about AI in real life"
  description="Only about AI in real life. Practical experiments for everyday humans. Learn about our mission and manifesto."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#E05A2B] text-[#FAF7F2] text-xs font-mono font-bold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-3 shadow-2xs">
        <span>ABOUT LAB</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#181715] tracking-tight">
        About Everyday AI Lab
      </h1>
      <p class="font-serif italic text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#E05A2B] mt-2 font-bold">
        日常AI：只聊生活中的 AI，记录普通人的日常实践。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Animated Brand Introduction with 3D Tilt -->
    <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] mb-12 bg-[#FAF7F2]">
      <video 
        autoplay 
        loop 
        muted 
        playsinline 
        width="1080" 
        height="1080"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover block"
      >
        <source src="/images/everyday-ai-intro.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        <img 
          src="/images/everyday-ai-intro.gif" 
          alt="Everyday AI Lab Animated Intro" 
          width="1080" 
          height="1080"
          loading="lazy" 
          decoding="async" 
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover" 
        />
      </video>
    </div>

    <!-- Brand Board Visual Preview with 3D Tilt -->
    <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] mb-12 bg-[#FAF7F2]">
      <img 
        src="/images/brand-board.webp" 
        alt="Everyday AI Lab Brand Visual Board" 
        width="1024" 
        height="572"
        loading="lazy" 
        decoding="async" 
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover" 
      />
    </div>

    <div class="prose-content">
      <h2>Why We Built This Living Lab</h2>
      <p>
        For the past year, the tech industry has been obsessed with trillion-parameter benchmarks and astronomical funding rounds. But as ordinary humans cooking dinners, managing households, caring for aging parents, and untangling messy schedules, we felt an immense disconnect.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most of us don't need a spaceship to reach Mars. We need a reliable Swiss Army knife in our desk drawer or on our kitchen counter.
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        <strong>Our Mission</strong>: Only about AI in real life. Practical experiments for everyday humans. No corporate jargon, just honest dispatches and actionable takeaways.
      </blockquote>

      <h2>Four Core Pillars</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>🧪 Life Labs</strong>: Real-life AI makeovers for daily living, cooking, family, health, and parenting.</li>
        <li><strong>⚡ Workflows</strong>: Zero-code practical productivity and end-to-end skill acquisition loops.</li>
        <li><strong>🧠 Habit Shifts</strong>: Unlearning keyword searching, mastering inquiry, and shifting from memorization to curation.</li>
        <li><strong>🧰 My Stack</strong>: Battle-tested daily AI apps, workflows, and reusable prompt blueprints.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 my-6">
        <details class="bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] group">
          <summary class="font-serif font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#181715] cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
            <span>What is Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz)? Who is it for?</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E05A2B] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#57524A] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz) is an independent living laboratory exploring human-centric AI applications. We explicitly reject corporate benchmark hype and trillion-parameter posturing. Instead, we document actionable, zero-code experiments solving concrete everyday friction: cooking, parenting, household dynamics, multi-variable commercial quoting, and weekly walk memos. It is tailored for ordinary creators, independent operators, and families seeking practical leverage.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] group">
          <summary class="font-serif font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#181715] cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
            <span>What are notable experimental case studies published here?</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E05A2B] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-sm text-[#57524A] mt-3 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p>Signature dispatches include:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
              <li><strong>40-Item Construction Material Quotation in 10 Minutes</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-09" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #09</a>): Turning a 4-hour manual Excel ordeal into a flawless executive PDF delivery.</li>
              <li><strong>ChillFirst — Cyber Emotional First Aid Station</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-08" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #08</a> / <a href="https://chill-first.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1E5E3A] font-bold hover:underline">chill-first.vercel.app</a>): Shipped in 48 hours to decompress from 2nd-grade homework trauma using 432Hz audio and custom AI personas.</li>
              <li><strong>14-Minute Empty Fridge Recovery Protocol</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-01" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #01</a>): AI vision meets culinary biochemistry to rescue a weeknight dinner in a single skillet.</li>
              <li><strong>10-Minute Walk Voice Memo to Weekly Action Plan</strong> (<a href="/en/posts/issue-02" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">Issue #02</a>): Transforming rambling speech into clean, prioritized Notion tasks.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] group">
          <summary class="font-serif font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-[#181715] cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
            <span>Why focus solely on daily life rather than frontier AI benchmarks?</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E05A2B] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#57524A] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Most humans do not need an interstellar spacecraft to reach Mars. We need a reliable Swiss Army knife on our kitchen counter or in our desk drawer. The true promise of technology is not for machines to brag about parameters, but to redeem real humans from soul-draining mechanics so they can go home on time.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <h2>Get in Touch & Collaborations</h2>
      <p>
        Got an everyday AI friction you want us to tackle, or interested in discussions and partnerships? Reach out directly via our official channels:
      </p>
      <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-[#FAF7F2] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-5 my-4 space-y-3 font-mono text-sm shadow-[0_4px_0_#181715]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>💬</span>
          <strong>Reader Desk (WhatsApp)</strong>:
          <a 
            href="https://wa.me/15024301078" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="text-[#1E5E3A] font-bold hover:underline"
          >
            Start a direct chat (+1 502-430-1078) →
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🐦</span>
          <strong>Official X (Twitter)</strong>:
          <a 
            href="https://x.com/edailab" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="text-[#181715] font-bold hover:text-[#E05A2B] hover:underline"
          >
            @edailab (Follow or DM) →
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🤖</span>
          <strong>LLM Machine Endpoints</strong>:
          <a href="/llms.txt" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">/llms.txt</a>
          <span class="text-[#8A847A]">·</span>
          <a href="/llms-full.txt" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">/llms-full.txt</a>
          <span class="text-[#8A847A]">·</span>
          <a href="/brand-facts.json" class="text-[#E05A2B] font-bold hover:underline">/brand-facts.json</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Structured Data FAQPage for AI and Search Engine rich snippets -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What is Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz)? Who is it for?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Everyday AI Lab (0500005.xyz) is an independent living laboratory exploring human-centric AI applications. We explicitly reject corporate benchmark hype and trillion-parameter posturing. Instead, we document actionable, zero-code experiments solving concrete everyday friction: cooking, parenting, household dynamics, multi-variable commercial quoting, and weekly walk memos."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What are notable experimental case studies published here?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Signature dispatches include: 1. 40-Item Construction Material Quotation in 10 Minutes (Issue #09); 2. ChillFirst — Cyber Emotional First Aid Station (Issue #08 / chill-first.vercel.app); 3. 14-Minute Empty Fridge Recovery Protocol (Issue #01); 4. 10-Minute Walk Voice Memo to Weekly Action Plan (Issue #02)."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Why focus solely on daily life rather than frontier AI benchmarks?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Most humans do not need an interstellar spacecraft to reach Mars. We need a reliable Swiss Army knife on our kitchen counter or in our desk drawer. The true promise of technology is to redeem real humans from soul-draining mechanics so they can go home on time."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    </script>

    <Newsletter lang="en" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
